{"ref":"BDB, דָּלַג","hw":"דָּלַג","html":"† <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">דָּלַג</span>]</big></big>  <strong>vb. leap (</strong>NH <em>spring over, skip</em> (a verse), omit<strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  Pt. <span dir=\"rtl\">דּוֹלֵג</span> <a data-ref=\"Zephaniah 1:9\" href=\"/Zephaniah.1.9\">Zp 1:9</a> <em>leap</em>, c. art. <em>one leaping</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">על־הַמִּפְתָּן</span>; 𝔊 <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 5:5\" href=\"/I_Samuel.5.5\">1 S 5:5</a> ὑπερβαίνοντες ὑπερβαίνουσιν = <span dir=\"rtl\">דָּלֹג יִדְלֹ֑גוּ</span> cf. Dr.<br><strong>Pi.</strong>  Impf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יְדַלֵּג</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 35:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.35.6\">Is 35:6</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲדַלֶּג־</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 18:30\" href=\"/Psalms.18.30\">ψ 18:30</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 22:30\" href=\"/II_Samuel.22.30\">2 S 22:30</a>; Pt. <span dir=\"rtl\">מְדַלֵּג</span> <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 2:8\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.2.8\">Ct 2:8</a>;—<em>leap, leap over</em> c. acc. <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁוּר</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 18:30\" href=\"/Psalms.18.30\">ψ 18:30</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 22:30\" href=\"/II_Samuel.22.30\">2 S 22:30</a>; abs. <em>leap as the stag</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">יְד׳ כָּאַיָּל פִּסֵּחַ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 35:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.35.6\">Is 35:6</a>; sq. <span dir=\"rtl\">על</span> of locality <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 2:8\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.2.8\">Ct 2:8</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מְקַפֵּץ</span>).","next":"BDB, דָּלָה","prev":"BDB, דַּל"}